section(class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-5 px-4 py-5 sm:px-5")
    div(class="border-b border-zinc-200 pb-5")
        div(class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between")
            div(class="max-w-3xl")
                p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500") Test Identity Provider
                h1(class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-3xl") SAML과 OIDC 테스트 흐름을 한 화면에서 준비합니다
                p(class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[13px] leading-6 text-zinc-600")
                    | SP/RP 담당자가 외부 IdP 없이 메타데이터, Discovery, JWKS, SSO, Token, Logout 흐름을 빠르게 검증할 수 있습니다.
            div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2")
                a(routerLink="/saml/register", class="inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-950 px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800") SAML 시작
                a(routerLink="/oidc/register", class="inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-zinc-800 transition hover:bg-zinc-50") OIDC 시작
                button(*ngIf="isAdmin()",
                    type="button",
                    class="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                    (click)="openPasswordModal()")
                    svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor")
                        path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z")
                    | 관리자 비밀번호

    div(*ngIf="isAdmin()", class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white")
        div(class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-200 px-4 py-3")
            div
                h2(class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") 운영 상태
                p(class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-500") 만료와 등록 현황을 간단히 확인합니다.
            span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-zinc-600") admin
        div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-8")
            span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...
        div(*ngIf="!loading", class="grid divide-y divide-zinc-200 md:grid-cols-5 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0")
            div(*ngFor="let item of expirySummary", class="px-4 py-3")
                p(class="truncate text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500") {{item.label}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950") {{item.value}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-zinc-500") {{item.description}}
            div(*ngFor="let item of summary.slice(0, 2)", class="px-4 py-3")
                p(class="truncate text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500") {{item.label}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950") {{item.value}}
                p(class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-zinc-500") {{item.description}}
        div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-zinc-200 px-4 py-3")
            a(href="#temporary-accounts", class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-100") Test Users
            a(routerLink="/saml/register", class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-100") SAML 관리
            a(routerLink="/oidc/register", class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-100") OIDC 관리

    div(class="grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2")
        a(routerLink="/saml/register", class="group rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 transition hover:border-zinc-400")
            div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                div(class="min-w-0")
                    p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500") SAML Identity Provider
                    h2(class="mt-2 text-[16px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") SP 등록과 IdP 메타데이터 배포
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-zinc-600") AuthnRequest, SAMLResponse, SLO 흐름을 등록한 SP 기준으로 검증합니다.
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-950 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition group-hover:bg-zinc-800") 열기
            div(class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5")
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") Metadata
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") SSO
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") SLO
        a(routerLink="/oidc/register", class="group rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 transition hover:border-zinc-400")
            div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                div(class="min-w-0")
                    p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500") OpenID Connect Provider
                    h2(class="mt-2 text-[16px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") RP 등록과 authorize/token 검증
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-zinc-600") Discovery, JWKS, PKCE, userinfo, logout 계약을 RP별로 확인합니다.
                span(class="rounded-md bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-zinc-300 transition group-hover:bg-zinc-50") 열기
            div(class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5")
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") Discovery
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") JWKS
                span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600") Token

    div(*ngIf="loading || defaultAccounts.length > 0", class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white")
        div(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-zinc-200 px-4 py-3")
            div
                h2(class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") 기본 테스트 계정
                p(class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-500") 관리용 admin 외 기본 테스트 계정은 제거되었습니다.
            span(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-zinc-600") {{ defaultAccounts.length }}개

        div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-8")
            span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...

        div(*ngIf="!loading && defaultAccounts.length > 0", class="overflow-x-auto")
            table(class="w-full min-w-[760px]")
                thead
                    tr(class="border-b border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50")
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 아이디
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 표시 이름
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 이메일
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 비밀번호
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 상태
                        th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 남은 시간
                tbody
                    tr(*ngFor="let item of defaultAccounts", class="border-b border-zinc-100 last:border-0 hover:bg-zinc-50")
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-900 font-mono") {{ item.username }}
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-600") {{ item.display_name || '-' }}
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-600 font-mono") {{ item.email || '-' }}
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-mono text-zinc-900") {{ item.password }}
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5")
                            span(class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700") 영구
                        td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 영구

    div(id="temporary-accounts", class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white")
        wiz-portal-idpcore-temp-account-list

div(*ngIf="passwordModalOpen",
    class="fixed inset-0 z-40 flex items-center justify-center bg-zinc-950/35 px-4 backdrop-blur-sm",
    (click)="closePasswordModal()")
    div(class="w-full max-w-md rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white shadow-2xl",
        (click)="$event.stopPropagation()")
        div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-zinc-200 px-5 py-4")
            div
                p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500") Admin Password
                h2(class="mt-1 text-[16px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") 관리자 비밀번호 변경
                p(class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 현재 로그인 중인 관리자 계정의 비밀번호를 교체합니다.
            button(type="button",
                class="rounded-md p-2 text-zinc-400 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-700",
                (click)="closePasswordModal()")
                svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="2", stroke="currentColor")
                    path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12")

        div(class="grid gap-3 px-5 py-4")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.current_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-500",
                placeholder="현재 비밀번호")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.new_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-500",
                placeholder="새 비밀번호 (8자 이상)")
            input(type="password",
                [(ngModel)]="passwordForm.confirm_password",
                (ngModelChange)="service.render()",
                class="w-full rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13px] text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-500",
                placeholder="새 비밀번호 확인")

        div(class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 border-t border-zinc-200 px-5 py-4")
            button(type="button",
                class="h-9 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-700 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                [disabled]="changingPassword",
                (click)="closePasswordModal()") 취소
            button(type="button",
                class="h-9 rounded-md bg-zinc-950 px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800 disabled:opacity-50",
                [disabled]="changingPassword",
                (click)="changePassword()") {{ changingPassword ? '변경 중...' : '비밀번호 변경' }}
